pot<li>Google Analytics<li>Hot Jar</ul></p><p><b>Cookies de Marketing</b></p><p>Os cookies de marketing fornecem informações sobre a interação do usuário com o conteúdo do nosso site, ajudando-nos a entender melhor a eficácia do nosso conteúdo de e-mail e website.</p><p><b><i>Cookies:</i></b><ul><li>Yahoo<li>Linkedin<li>Google/DoubleClick<li>TheTradeDesk<li>Criteo<li>Facebook<li>Google AdSense<li>Amazonas<li>MediaMath<li>SmartAdServer<li>.smartadserver.com<li>Bing<li>Microsoft MSN<li>Tail Target<li>Youtube<li>Hot Jar<li>AppNexus Inc.<li>Rubicon Project<li>adnxs.com</ul></p></div></div></div><div class=accordion-item><span for=accordion-policy-1 id=accordion-policy-c-1 class=oPrivallyApp-PolicyAccordionButton onclick=" if( document.getElementsByClassName('accordion-policy-c-1')[0].className.match(/\bopenedHeight\b/) ){document.getElementsByClassName('accordion-policy-c-1')[0].classList.remove('openedHeight'); document.getElementsByClassName('accordion-policy-c-1')[0].classList.add('closedHeight'); document.getElementsByClassName('arrow-policy-c-1')[0].classList.remove('oPrivallyApp-ArrowBottom'); document.getElementsByClassName('arrow-policy-c-1')[0].classList.add('oPrivallyApp-ArrowRight'); }else{ document.getElementsByClassName('accordion-policy-c-1')[0].classList.remove('closedHeight'); document.getElementsByClassName('accordion-policy-c-1')[0].classList.add('openedHeight'); document.getElementsByClassName('arrow-policy-c-1')[0].classList.remove('oPrivallyApp-ArrowRight'); document.getElementsByClassName('arrow-policy-c-1')[0].classList.add('oPrivallyApp-ArrowBottom'); }"> Pol&iacute;tica de Privacidade <span class="arrow-policy-c-1 oPrivallyApp-ArrowRight"></span></span><div class="oPrivally-accordion-content accordion-policy-c-1 "><div class="oPrivallyApp-ModalPanelText oPrivallyApp-ModalTextScroll oPrivallyApp-ModalTextPolicy"><!--<br>--><p><a href="https://www.vagas.com.br/politica-privacidade" target=_blank class=oPrivallyApp-link title="https://w